<textList name="EVLBL_FUEL_ON_MANTIS_ATTACK">
	<text>[ No fuel: Mantis fight ]

A Mantis ship hails you, "Looks like we found the poor fools that need some help. Come brothers, let's 'help' them!" They move in to attack.</text>
	<text>[ No fuel: Mantis fight ]

Before long a ship jumps nearby, no doubt responding to your beacon. However any relief you felt disappears as soon as you recognize that the ship is of Mantis design. Prepare for a fight.</text>
	<text>[ No fuel: Mantis fight ]

You detect a Mantis ship approaching and hack into their comm channel and hear, "...hope they put up more of a fight than the last Federation ship. This has been a disappointing day so far." Looks like they're not here to help.</text>
	<text>[ No fuel: Mantis fight ]

A Mantis ship jump nearby. Sensors detect weapon locks and all hope of avoiding a fight fades away.</text>
	<text>[ No fuel: Mantis fight ]

A Mantis ship hails you, "Looks like we found the poor fools that need some help. Come brothers, let's 'help' them!" They move in to attack.</text>
